Independent, unofficial documentation and agent skills for editing local
CapCut projects with `capcutctl`. Not affiliated with ByteDance, CapCut,
or Lemon Inc.

The default house style in `capcut-editing/references/style.md` was measured
from the author's finished drafts. Treat it as *an* editing grammar, not a
requirement for using the CLI. Do not copy CapCut binaries, effect packages,
or third-party logos into this repository.

See also: https://github.com/RoXsaita/capcut-editor-cli
